# BUG-008 — Remove Button Does Not Remove Product

## Bug Type
Functional Bug

## Module
Shopping Cart

## Severity
High

## Priority
High

## Steps to Reproduce
1. Add a product to the cart.
2. Open Cart.
3. Click Remove.

## Expected Result
The selected product should be removed from the cart.

## Actual Result
The product remains visible in the cart after clicking Remove.

